@startuml
title Sentry event capture: exception/request to transport

participant "FastAPI / Starlette" as WEB
participant "_sentry_init_options" as POLICY
participant "Sentry SDK\nevent construction" as SDK
participant "_before_send_filter" as FILTER
participant "Sentry transport" as TRANSPORT

POLICY -> SDK : init integrations, sampling, hooks (H2)
WEB -> SDK : exception / transaction + request context (H1)
SDK -> SDK : build stack frames; implicit local capture (H3)
SDK -> SDK : derive request metadata; implicit body capture (H4)
SDK -> FILTER : constructed event (H5)
FILTER -> FILTER : remove env/cookies/query; redact known keys
FILTER -> TRANSPORT : filtered envelope (H6)

note over POLICY,SDK
Required capture boundary:
include_local_variables = false
max_request_body_size = never
end note

note over FILTER
Retained as defense in depth for
headers, query strings, extras and
integration-supplied event data.
end note
@enduml
